    <item>
      <title>Claude Fable 5的内心戏被看光了：AI是在思考，还是在发疯？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/claude-fable-5ai-20260704131009025-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 13:10:09 +0800</pubDate>
